    "updateTime": "2026-11-09T09:50:00+08:00",
    "generalSituationZh": "受冷鋒相關的強烈東北季候風影響，廣東地區今日風勢頗大，氣溫顯著下降，未來兩三日該區普遍晴朗及非常乾燥，早上清涼，日夜溫差頗大。預料季候風會在本週後期緩和，該區氣溫回升。而高空擾動會在接近週末為華南帶來驟雨。此外，熱帶氣旋查帕卡會在未來一兩日橫過日本以南海域。",
    "generalSituationEn": "Under the influence of the intense northeast monsoon associated with a cold front, it will be windy and temperatures will fall appreciably over Guangdong today. The weather will be generally fine and very dry over the region in the next couple of days. It will be cool in the morning. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. The monsoon is expected to moderate in the latter part of this week, temperatures will rise over the region. Upper-air disturbances will bring showers to southern China towards the weekend. Besides, Tropical Cyclone Cempaka will move across the seas south of Japan in the next couple of days.",
